            <li>Singh S, et al. <a href="https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4333001" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Diagnostic performance of magnetic resonance elastography in staging liver fibrosis: a systematic review and meta-analysis of individual participant data</a>. Clinical Gastroenterology and Hepatology, 2015.</li>
